{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TOJIBO</strong> is a relaxing, <strong>two-player-only</strong> co-op platformer where two robots, T0J1 and J1B0, must work together to climb to the top. Explore the remains of a fallen civilization as these two robot friends, still functioning from a bygone era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch co-op:</strong> Grab two controllers and a friend, then enjoy the climb together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op:</strong> Thanks to rollback netcode, enjoy smooth online play with no input latency or desyncs, even if you're continents apart!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carrying is caring:</strong> The core mechanic revolves around carrying and throwing. Haul a wild range of objects and throw them at useful targets. You can even carry your partner!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing puzzles:</strong>\u00a0Puzzles are designed for fun cooperation, not frustration!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809740/extras/d8827aa6a840d0d67600e628344acd8c.poster.avif?t=1762109057\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809740/extras/d8827aa6a840d0d67600e628344acd8c.webm?t=1762109057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809740/extras/d8827aa6a840d0d67600e628344acd8c.mp4?t=1762109057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the climb!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809740?t=1762109057","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809740?t=17