:</strong>\u00a0Puzzles are designed for fun cooperation, not frustration!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809740/extras/d8827aa6a840d0d67600e628344acd8c.poster.avif?t=1762109057\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809740/extras/d8827aa6a840d0d67600e628344acd8c.webm?t=1762109057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809740/extras/d8827aa6a840d0d67600e628344acd8c.mp4?t=1762109057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the climb!</p>","developers":["Vermeil Soft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809740/1a9f8a290b7f0b905b1bb9e98ffc7f895e34d497/header.jpg?t=1762109057","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> CPU Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3809740/1159371321/948ded9457217332cf1e8d3f3599c64862474eff/1758639842/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758641515","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3809740/1159371321/948ded9457217332